{"name": "Oby Adventure", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Jump, dash and explore the colorful</i> <br/><i> Fruitimal Kingdom in this charming platform adventure.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Explore the Fruitimal Kingdom\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/150bc302b2c0ed2398ed2b2914e529ec.webp?t=1787960460\" width=\"640\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Travel across vibrant lands filled with curious Fruitimals, ancient ruins and mysterious places. Each region of the <i>Fruitimal Kingdom</i> offers new environments, playful details and surprising discoveries.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/d5ab9616c486ceb03b593c21bc17b8c5.poster.avif?t=1787960460\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/d5ab9616c486ceb03b593c21bc17b8c5.webm?t=1787960460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/d5ab9616c486ceb03b593c21bc17b8c5.mp4?t=1787960460\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Master precise platforming\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/5f138ac6a5e9539939455810126de6f8.webp?t=1787960460\" width=\"640\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Run, jump and dash through carefully crafted levels designed to test your timing and skill. Smooth controls and clever level design create a satisfying flow where every jump matters.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/02a02756841ce763d927a8d328f31152.poster.avif?t=1787960460\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/02a02756841ce763d927a8d328f31152.webm?t=1787960460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/02a02756841ce763d927a8d328f31152.mp4?t=1787960460\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Discover hidden secrets\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/5a07bdf4d90aac7f5234e59f53694669.webp?t=1787960460\" width=\"640\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Keep your eyes open \u2014 the world of <i>Oby Adventure</i> is full of hidden paths, secret rooms and clever surprises. Exploring off the beaten path often leads to rewards for curious players.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/7383a1410bc5fe5a1b954ef856077787.avif?t=1787960460\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"Race for the fastest times\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/32ca0a269a951e546883454f95297508.webp?t=1787960460\" width=\"640\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Master special challenges, improve your best scores and times, and compete on online leaderboards.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-hidden=\"true\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/f397c3ee9cea39583f19a4c8d28cc128.poster.avif?t=1787960460\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/f397c3ee9cea39583f19a4c8d28cc128.webm?t=1787960460\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/f397c3ee9cea39583f19a4c8d28cc128.mp4?t=1787960460\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"The journey begins\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"50\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/7403b1103564551c82fc9d63edf5c67a.webp?t=1787960460\" width=\"640\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">An army of malicious creatures has invaded the peaceful <i>Fruitimal Kingdom</i>. Whispers of <i>Draco\u2019s</i> return spread across the land. The king calls for help. As <strong>Oby</strong>, you journey through the kingdom to recover the missing shards of an ancient artifact needed to unlock <i>The Source</i>. The only power capable of defeating the darkness.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/extras/8a934099827ecd22e7994d7238ea4d67.avif?t=1787960460\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Join Oby on an adventure inspired by the colorful platformers of the 1990s and 2000s. Jump, run and stomp enemies through playful levels packed with surprises. Defeat mighty bosses and restore peace to the Fruitimal Kingdom.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862400/5992c047eaf2d3f87ac5ae5dae67311bd478c75b/header.jpg?t=1787960460", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["2D Platformer", "Platformer", "Side Scroller", "Action-Adventure", "Adventure", "Action"], "developers": "Oby's Farm", "publishers": "Oby's Farm", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3862400", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/avcxBxgPEYc", "first_seen": 1775772000.0, "review_rank": 864}